## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Security — Strong Name Key (SC-009)
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The private key must NEVER be committed to the repository.
# Store it in CI secrets (e.g., STRONG_NAME_KEY_BASE64 in GitHub Actions Secrets).
# The public key is baked into Directory.Build.props; signing is conditional on Exists().
EricksonLopez.snk

